# Billing Events — payment and subscription features

note These events describe the billing and payment system

event payment method added
category billing
matter
  title is User can add a credit or debit card
  priority is high
  status is todo
end

event subscription started
category billing
matter
  title is User can choose and start a plan
  priority is medium
  status is todo
end

layer billing features
  payment method added
  subscription started
end
